\begin{abstract}
This paper establishes hypercontractive inequalities for weighted Bergman spaces defined on the unit ball. Furthermore, we provide nearly exact formulas for the involved constants and demonstrate additional properties concerning hypercontractivity in these spaces.
\end{abstract}
\begin{keywords}
hypercontractivity; weighted Bergman spaces; associated constants
\end{keywords}
